        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:CHEBI_35482</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A narcotic or opioid substance, synthetic or semisynthetic agent producing profound analgesia, drowsiness, and changes in mood.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
