        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:IAO_0000028</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">2014-03-31: We would like to have a deeper analysis of &apos;mark&apos; and &apos;sign&apos; in the future (see https://github.com/information-artifact-ontology/IAO/issues/154).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
