        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:IAO_0000078</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">The curation status of the term. The allowed values come from an enumerated list of predefined terms. See the specification of these instances for more detailed definitions of each enumerated value.</Literal>
