        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:IAO_0000144</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">that fucoidan has a small statistically significant effect on AT3 level but no useful clinical effect as in-vivo anticoagulant, a paraphrase of part of the last paragraph of the discussion section of the paper &apos;Pilot clinical study to evaluate the anticoagulant activity of fucoidan&apos;, by Lowenthal et. al.PMID:19696660</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
