        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:NCIT_C40037</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A neoplasm of low malignant potential arising from the ovary.  It is characterized by the proliferation of neoplastic mucinous epithelial cells that resemble intestinal epithelial cells.  There is no evidence of stromal invasion.</Literal>
