    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBIB_0000634</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">MB: This class should probably be a subclass to CRID. However, the textual definition of CRID right now states that each instance has the CRID identifier as a part. This is not the case for telephone numbers. Therefore, they cannot be subsumed under CRID now. I am looking into changing IAO accordingly. Once that is done, the class ought to be a subclass of CRID.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
