        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBIB_0000695</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A study design that involves repeated observations of the same entity over time. In the biobank context, longitudinal studies sample a group of people in a given time period, and study them at intervals by the acquisition and analyses of data and/or samples over time.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
