        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBIB_0000704</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">It could be argued as to why this class was not created as an &apos;objective specification&apos;. However, the emphasis here is to &apos;a briefing of how the specimen in the sample collection have been handled as an indication of specimen quality.&apos;</Literal>
