        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBIB_0002104</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The capability of an infrastructure to perform histological analyses on biological specimens for the microscopic examination and characterization of tissue structure and cellular morphology.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
