        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBIB_0002114</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A sample collection setting in which biological specimens are collected as part of a public health initiative or population-based study for surveillance, epidemiological research, or health assessment.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
