        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000112</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>liver section; a portion of a culture of cells; a nemotode or other animal once no longer a subject (generally killed); portion of blood from a patient.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
