        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000124</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The relation between the conclusion &quot;Gene tpbA is involved in EPS production&quot; and the data items produced using two sets of organisms, one being a tpbA knockout, the other being tpbA wildtype tested in polysacharide production assays and analyzed using an ANOVA.</Literal>
