        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000260</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A plan is a realizable entity that is the inheres in a bearer who is committed to realizing it as a planned process.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000260</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>This class is included to make clear how the plan specification, the plan, and the planned process relate. OBI will however only subclass and work under the &apos;plan specification&apos;, and &apos;planned process&apos; class, as we want to avoid to get deep into discussions of &apos;intend&apos; etc.</Literal>
