        <Literal xml:lang="en">drawing a conclusion based on data</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000111"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>planning</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000112"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>The process of a scientist thinking about and deciding what reagents to use as part of a protocol for an experiment. Note that the scientist could be human or a &quot;robot scientist&quot; executing software.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000114"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:IAO_0000122</AbbreviatedIRI>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">a process of creating or modifying a plan specification</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>7/18/2011 BP: planning used to itself be a planned process. Barry Smith pointed out that this would lead to an infinite regression, as there would have to be a plan to conduct a planning process, which in itself would be the result of planning etc. Therefore, the restrictions on &apos;planning&apos; were loosened to allow for informal processes that result in an &apos;ad hoc plan &apos;. This required changing from &apos;has_specified_output some plan specifiction&apos; to &apos;has_participant some plan specification&apos;.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000117"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Bjoern Peters</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000119"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000339</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Bjoern Peters</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
