        <Literal>6/11/9: edited at workshop. Used to be: study design execution is a process with the objective to generate data according to a concretized study design. The execution of a study design is part of an investigation, and minimally consists of an assay or data transformation.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
