    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000651</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>4/10/2011BP: It seems to me that the editor notes refer to a previous version, and are no longer relevant.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000651</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>This could be instead a kind of collection of secreted stuff. Among secreted stuff there is passive, and active. urine is secreted, passiv.  lavage is secreted, active</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000651</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>are we happy calling collection of urine a material separation?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
