        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000652</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>is a material processing with the objective to combine two or more material entities as input into a single material entity as output.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000652</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>created at workshop as parent class for &apos;adding material into target&apos;, which is asymmetric, while combination encompasses all addition processes.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
