        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0000915</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>2010/3/3 Alan Ruttenberg: There is a question of whether we should have a separate objective to &quot;prepare for maintenance&quot;
2014/2/3 OBI dev call: &quot;prepare for maintenance&quot; is a separate process. For example, &apos;freezing&apos; and &apos;flash freezing&apos; are defined and can be used to produce frozen material for storage.
Updated both textual and logical definition. Both input and output material of freezing storage have quality frozen.</Literal>
