        <Literal>A plan specification comprised of protocols (which may specify how and what kinds of data will be gathered) that are executed as part of an investigation and is realized during a study design execution.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0500000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Editor note: there is at least an implicit restriction on the kind of data transformations that can be done based on the measured data available.</Literal>
