        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0600024</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">When harvesting blood from a human, isolating T cells, and then limited dilution cloning of the cells, the maintaining_cell_culture step comprises all steps after the initial dilution and plating of the cells into culture, e.g. placing the culture into an incubator, changing or adding media, and splitting a cell culture</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
