        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OGMS_0000090</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A planned process whose completion is hypothesized by a health care provider to eliminate, prevent, or alleviate a disorder, the signs and symptoms of a disorder, or a pathological process</Literal>
