        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OGMS_0000104</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A health care process that involves the interpretation of a clinical picture from a given patient (input) and the assertion to the effect that the patient has a disease, disorder, or syndrome of a certain type, or none of these (output).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
