        <Literal xml:lang="en">This definition corresponds to that used by OMB. It is worth noting that the OMB definition from which this one is derived is problematic, in that it implies that one&apos;s race cannot be Native American or Alaskan Native unless one maintains tribal affiliations or community attachment.</Literal>
