        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:RO_0002211</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>p regulates q iff p is causally upstream of q, the execution of p is not constant and varies according to specific conditions, and p influences the rate or magnitude of execution of q due to an effect either on some enabler of q or some enabler of a part of q.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
