        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:RO_0002411</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>p is causally upstream of q iff p is causally related to q, the end of p precedes the end of q, and p is not an occurrent part of q.</Literal>
