        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:UBERON_0000316</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A substance produced by the cervix and endocervical glands[BTO]. Thick acidic mucus that blocks the cervical os after mestruation[WP]. This &apos;infertile&apos; mucus blocks spermatozoa from entering the uterus.</Literal>
